	(text "LT3045 (+15 V) and LT3094 (-15 V) post-regulate the ADP5071 rails (+16.4 V / -16.5 V, Rails +-15V sheet) to +/-14.7 V: VOUT = 100 uA x RSET (147k; +15 V is the top of the LT3045 range)."
